13. Result

After completing Week 9, the game has a complete basic user interface. Players can start the game from the main menu, see their score, restart the game after losing, or exit the application.

The high-score system also successfully saves and loads the highest score using file handling.

14. Conclusion

Week 9 successfully improved the user experience and functionality of the Chicken Cross Road game. The addition of the UIManager provides organized user-interface management, while SaveSystem provides persistent high-score storage. These features make the game more complete and user-friend